# The Cold Hearths — Cinderwick, the burnt town: G Dorian (the shared key's), a clarinet's tune
# over a harp in three, low strings, a cracked bell. Original, cb17 (2026-10-29). 8 bars of 3/4 at
# 72: 20 s, a loop.
